  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Awareness, Empowerment and Accountability for Human Rights in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the project is to create a society that upholds the right to equality, dignity and non-discrimination for all citizens and residents; in which duty bearers respect, protect and fulfil all those rights and freedoms to which rights-holders are entitled under the Constitution and international human rights law. The project contributes to this through (1) advocacy for awareness and understanding, which transpires into empowerment, among rights holders of the rights, and duty bearers of their obligation to respect, protect and fulfil these rights, and (2) empowering vulnerable, marginalized and excluded groups, enabling them to articulate and claim their rights more effectively.</narrative>
  </description>
